    <!-- Daily Recap Content -->
    <string name="recap_daily_item_1">Major tech breakthroughs: OpenAI announces GPT-5 with enhanced reasoning capabilities, Apple unveils new AI features for iOS 18. Tech sector experiences major market volatility with NVIDIA reaching all-time highs.</string>
    <string name="recap_daily_item_2">Global climate summit concludes with new carbon reduction targets. 195 nations agree to accelerate renewable energy adoption, with China and EU pledging net-zero emissions by 2050.</string>
    <string name="recap_daily_item_3">Economic updates: Federal Reserve maintains interest rates at 5.25%, citing inflation concerns. Markets mixed as tech stocks rise while energy sector drops amid oil price volatility.</string>
    <string name="recap_daily_item_4">International relations: US and India sign new trade agreement focusing on semiconductor manufacturing and clean energy cooperation. Deal expected to create 50,000 jobs and strengthen supply chain resilience.</string>
    <string name="recap_daily_item_5">Sports and entertainment: Olympic preparations enter final stages, expected to attract millions of global viewers. Major film festivals announce winners, with several independent films gaining widespread recognition.</string>
    
    <!-- Weekly Recap Content -->
    <string name="recap_weekly_header">This week,</string>
    <string name="recap_weekly_date_range">Dec 9-15</string>
    <string name="recap_weekly_item_1">Major AI developments this week as Google launches Gemini 2.0, Microsoft integrates Copilot across all Office products, and Meta announces new VR headset with neural interface technology. AI market cap reaches $2.3 trillion.</string>
    <string name="recap_weekly_item_2">Global central banks adjust monetary policies with European Central Bank cutting rates by 0.5%, Bank of Japan ending negative rates, and emerging markets seeing increased foreign investment. Global economy shows signs of stabilization.</string>
    <string name="recap_weekly_item_3" formatted="false">Major breakthrough in renewable energy as solar panel efficiency reaches 47% in lab tests. Global wind power installations increase by 35%, with carbon capture technology receiving $12 billion in new investment this week.</string>
    <string name="recap_weekly_item_4">Revolutionary gene therapy shows breakthrough in treating rare genetic diseases, with multiple clinical trials showing significant efficacy. Global healthtech investment reaches record highs.</string>
    <string name="recap_weekly_item_5">International sporting events deliver spectacular performances with multiple world records broken. Cultural exchange activities increase, promoting mutual understanding and cooperation between nations.</string>
    
    <!-- Monthly Recap Content -->
    <string name="recap_monthly_header">This month,</string>
    <string name="recap_monthly_date_range">December</string>
    <string name="recap_monthly_item_1">Technology sector experiences major breakthroughs this month with multiple AI model releases, quantum computing advances, and successful space exploration missions. Global tech investment reaches record highs with emerging technologies being widely adopted.</string>
    <string name="recap_monthly_item_2">Central banks adjust monetary policies this month with inflation pressures easing and employment markets stabilizing. International trade agreements signed, global supply chains gradually recovering, with clear signs of economic recovery.</string>
    <string name="recap_monthly_item_3">Global climate action achieves important progress this month with significant increase in renewable energy investment and carbon reduction targets met ahead of schedule. Multiple countries announce carbon neutrality plans as green technology innovation accelerates.</string>
    <string name="recap_monthly_item_4">Social development achieves significant results this month with improved educational equity, enhanced healthcare services, and accelerated digital transformation. Global cooperation strengthens with new progress on sustainable development goals.</string>
    <string name="recap_monthly_item_5">Global cultural and artistic activities flourish with major exhibitions and performances attracting widespread attention. Sports sector achieves new breakthroughs with athletes setting multiple new records.</string>
